<title>FINLAND: Kemira 4-mth profit falls 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Kemira 4-mth profit falls 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     377 vs 477</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    2.0 vs 2.8</p>
<p> Net sales					  5,129 vs 4,825</p>
<p> Operating profit				   473 vs 626</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 11 analysts' forecasts for Finnish chemicals and fertiliser group Kemira Oy's profit before extras and tax had been 365 million markka in a 290-420 million range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					 323 vs 324</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 96 vs 149 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			charge 24 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		353 vs 477</p>
<p> Taxes						  107 vs 135</p>
<p> Minorities				    charge 5 vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					   241 vs 341</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    36.2 vs 34.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Kemira Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
